---
// Where I started (spec §5.1 item 4): one compact card linking to the older portfolio.
---
<a class="origin" href="https://acrispycookie.dev">
  <div class="blk" aria-hidden="true">
    {/* Minecraft and work (Jason, 2026-10-22): a grass block beside the plugin code behind it */}
    <svg data-kind="minecraft" viewBox="0 0 320 200" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice">
      <rect width="320" height="200" fill="#183539" />
      {/* the block and the code window centred as one group; indents are x offsets (SVG drops leading spaces) */}
      <g class="art">
        <g transform="translate(18 42)">
          <path d="M54 0 L108 27 L54 54 L0 27 Z" fill="#6bbf59" />
          <path d="M0 27 L54 54 V116 L0 89 Z" fill="#8a5a3c" /><path d="M108 27 L54 54 V116 L108 89 Z" fill="#6e4630" />
          <path d="M0 27 L54 54 V67 L0 40 Z" fill="#5aa64a" /><path d="M108 27 L54 54 V67 L108 40 Z" fill="#4c8f3e" />
          <path d="M12 52 l9 4.5 v9 l-9 -4.5 Z M32 70 l9 4.5 v9 l-9 -4.5 Z" fill="#5b3a28" /><path d="M72 76 l9 -4.5 v9 l-9 4.5 Z" fill="#4f3222" />
        </g>
        <rect class="win" x="146" y="36" width="156" height="128" rx="10" fill="#11282d" />
        <circle cx="160" cy="50" r="3.5" fill="#ff6b5e" /><circle cx="171" cy="50" r="3.5" fill="#f0a64a" /><circle cx="182" cy="50" r="3.5" fill="#86e3bd" />
        <g font-family="ui-monospace, monospace" font-size="9.5">{/* taste-skill-ignore: literal Java code */}
          <text x="158" y="76" fill="#41e2f2">class Plugin</text><text x="168" y="90" fill="#41e2f2">extends JavaPlugin &#123;</text>
          <text x="168" y="110" fill="#9db6b8">onEnable() &#123;</text><text x="178" y="124" fill="#d8b46a">register(...)</text>
          <text x="168" y="138" fill="#9db6b8">&#125;</text><text x="158" y="152" fill="#41e2f2">&#125;</text>
        </g>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div>
    <h3>Where I started: Minecraft plugins</h3>
    <p>From 2019 to 2023 I wrote Java plugins, first for my own server, ColonyMC, which reached 20–30 players, then as a freelancer for other servers.</p>
  </div>
  <span class="btn btn-secondary">See them on acrispycookie.dev</span>
</a>
